{title: Mighty to Save}
{song_number: 23}
{language: en}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[D]Everyone needs compassion,
love that's [A]never failing. Let [E]mercy fall on me.
[D]Everyone needs forgiveness,
the [A]kindness of a Sa[F#m]viour, the [E]hope of nations.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[A]Saviour, He can move the [E]mountains.
My God is [D]mighty to save, [A]He is [F#m]mighty to save. [E]
For[A]ever, Author of Sal[E]vation.
He rose and [D]conquered the grave; [A]Jesus [F#m]conquered the [E]grave.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: 2}
[D]So take me as You find me,
all my [A]fears and failures. [E]Fill my life again.
[D]I give my life to follow
every[A]thing I believe [F#m]in. Now [E]I surrender.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[A]Saviour, He can move the [E]mountains.
My God is [D]mighty to save, [A]He is [F#m]mighty to save. [E]
For[A]ever, Author of Sal[E]vation.
He rose and [D]conquered the grave; [A]Jesus [F#m]conquered the [E]grave.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_bridge}
[D]Shine Your light, and [A]let the whole world [E]see. We're [F#m]singing
[D]for the glory [A]of the risen [E]King. [F#m]Jesus.
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_chorus}
[A]Saviour, He can move the [E]mountains.
My God is [D]mighty to save, [A]He is [F#m]mighty to save. [E]
For[A]ever, Author of Sal[E]vation.
He rose and [D]conquered the grave; [A]Jesus [F#m]conquered the [E]grave.
{end_of_chorus}
